@startuml
title 02b - Auth Forgot Password
autonumber

actor "Frontend / Postman" as FE
participant "Gateway :8099" as GW
participant "Auth Service :8091" as AUTH
database "Auth DB" as ADB
collections "SMTP" as SMTP

FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/auth/forgot-password\n{username}
GW -> AUTH: Forward (public endpoint)

AUTH -> ADB: Find user by username
ADB --> AUTH: user/email or empty

alt user exists and email exists
  AUTH -> AUTH: Generate OTP
  AUTH -> ADB: Save OTP token (unused, expiry)
  AUTH -> SMTP: Send OTP email
  AUTH --> GW: Success message
else user not found or email missing
  AUTH --> GW: Same generic success message
end

GW --> FE: Response

note over FE
Generic success message avoids user enumeration.
end note

@enduml

